  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the kadhai and steam it for 5 minutes.",
    "Chop the lemongrass, ginger, and green onions.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the mustard oil, turmeric powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Place a fillet of fish in the kadhai, and brush the mixture evenly over both sides of the fish.",
    "Sprinkle a pinch of chopped cilantro and chopped green onions over the fish for garnish.",
    "Pour 2 tablespoons of coconut milk over the fish for added moisture and flavor.",
    "Place a cup of brown rice in a separate bowl for serving.",
    "Steam the fish for 8-10 minutes, or until it is cooked through and flaky.",
    "Serve the steamed fish over the brown rice, garnished with additional chopped cilantro and green onions if desired.",
    "Drizzle the walnut oil over the top of the dish for a finishing touch.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
